    "Id": "chassisdef_dervish_iic_DV-IIC-III",
    "Name": "Dervish IIC",
    "Details": "Developed by Clan Burrock to augment second line units, the Dervish IIC is a rebuild of a number of Star League Dervishes found in a Brian Cache. Eventually spreading to other Clans, the design would prove to be a dependable and tough Mech, with a production line opening in 3000 to meet the Burrocks needs. Armed with an ER Large Laser for ranged combat; with 6 SRM-4's providing close range firepower, the 55 ton Dervish IIC-3 is powered by a 275 rated Fusion Core.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
